  "implementation": [
    "Serialize custom agent saves and removals on a recoverable queue, reading the latest acknowledged collection inside each operation.",
    "Deep-copy and validate submitted profiles before enqueue; require a real native setter, reject false acknowledgements and retain legacy undefined acknowledgements from an actual setter. Publish only after accepted persistence.",
    "Guard editor actions before awaits. Keep fields stable while pending, retain creation drafts after failure, catch removal failures and preserve unrelated drafts when profiles are removed.",
    "Give pending persistence a focused status that keeps Tab and Shift+Tab inside the modal; restore the initiating control after failure/cancellation without stealing focus from the opened workflow form.",
    "Use semantic theme surfaces, complete wrapped profile names, selected-tool contrast and consistent primary controls; keep saved-state status truthful while initialization is unavailable.",
    "Render shared modal overlays through a body portal so page stacking and overflow cannot obscure them behind the sidebar. Native probes verify centered placement, viewport coverage, unobscured title/profile/input hit targets and enabled readable inputs in both themes.",
    "Retain custom-agent identity and complete bounded configuration across an actual native process restart; remove the saved profile without losing a new draft, then create/select its replacement.",
    "Retain dark/light manager captures in both CI workflows and scan the named agent dialog with scoped Axe."
  ],
